+      "name": "Pageable",
+      "version": "1.0.0",
+      "description": "Adds pagination controls to list and collection views. Pageable injects a pagination bar\ninto the footer region, wires page state to the data layer, and provides semantic token\nmappings for consistent pagination UI styling across brands.\n\nThe trait supports configurable page sizes, total item counts for page calculation,\nand both simple (prev/next) and full (goto page) navigation modes. Page state is managed\nvia the page and pageSize props, which the consuming layout binds to data offset/limit\nparameters or API pagination cursors.",
+      "category": "behavioral",
+      "tags": [
+        "pagination",
+        "list-behavior",
+        "navigation",
+        "data-loading"
